{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119547","id":3703124534,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7cuTI2","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119547","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119547.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119547.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119547","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119547/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119547/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119547/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/37469a163b70790929cd291fcdbb98855f89556c","number":119547,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[ios] Fix missing UIScene URL lifecycle events for app delegate services","user":{"login":"cengiz-pz","id":112892340,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrqZtA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112892340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz","html_url":"https://github.com/cengiz-pz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cengiz-pz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #118600\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSince the migration to the scene-based iOS lifecycle introduced in #116395, `UIKit` no longer dispatches certain lifecycle events through `UIApplicationDelegate`. As a result, callbacks such as `application:openURL:options:` are no longer invoked in the new scene-based approach, preventing iOS plugins registered through `GDTApplicationDelegate` from receiving deeplink and user activity events.\r\n\r\nThis PR forwards the relevant `UISceneDelegate` lifecycle callbacks to registered `GDTAppDelegateServiceProtocol` services, restoring support for custom URL schemes and user activity handling in iOS services such as [DeeplinkService](https://github.com/godot-mobile-plugins/godot-deeplink/blob/1666a58e6d375e817d7d93180089f6eb60f7bc5f/ios/src/deeplink_service.h#L10).\r\n\r\n## Backward Compatibility\r\n\r\nCompatibility changes were already introduced by #116395, requiring services to adopt `UIWindowSceneDelegate` in addition to `UIApplicationDelegate`.\r\n\r\nGiven that service implementations already require code-level changes, this PR intentionally exposes the scene-based lifecycle callbacks directly rather than attempting to translate them back into deprecated `UIApplicationDelegate`-style events.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiscenedelegate\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","col